<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: charge lance -->
  <FH_Gun_BastionmeldChargeLance.label>电荷标枪</FH_Gun_BastionmeldChargeLance.label>
  <!-- EN: A pulse-charged rail-assisted lance weapon. It fires a single shot at high velocity, charging it with unstable energy as it leaves the acceleration rail. -->
  <FH_Gun_BastionmeldChargeLance.description>一种脉冲充能的轨道辅助标枪武器。它会以高速发射单发弹丸，并在弹丸离开加速轨道时为其注入不稳定能量。</FH_Gun_BastionmeldChargeLance.description>
  <!-- EN: charge lance -->
  <FH_Gun_BastionmeldChargeLance.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>电荷标枪</FH_Gun_BastionmeldChargeLance.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: inferno cannon -->
  <FH_Gun_BastionmeldInfernoCannon.label>地狱火加农炮</FH_Gun_BastionmeldInfernoCannon.label>
  <!-- EN: An incendiary-shot mini-artillery device. It fires a large incendiary warhead. -->
  <FH_Gun_BastionmeldInfernoCannon.description>一种发射燃烧弹的小型火炮装置。它会射出大型燃烧弹头。</FH_Gun_BastionmeldInfernoCannon.description>
  <!-- EN: inferno cannon -->
  <FH_Gun_BastionmeldInfernoCannon.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>地狱火加农炮</FH_Gun_BastionmeldInfernoCannon.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Beam Incinerator Cannon -->
  <FH_Gun_BastionmeldTrackingLaser.label>焚灭脉冲炮</FH_Gun_BastionmeldTrackingLaser.label>
  <!-- EN: A tracking thermal beam cannon designed for wide-area lethality. It must lock onto a target and charge for several seconds before firing a sustained searing beam. The end of the beam corrects its own trajectory; anything swept by it will be badly burned, and the ground will ignite. Keep moving or be caught. Cannot fire at targets that are too close. -->
  <FH_Gun_BastionmeldTrackingLaser.description>专为大范围杀伤而设计的追踪型热光束加农炮。需要锁定目标充能数秒，随后发射一道持续的炙热光束。光束末段会自行修正弹道，任何被扫到的单位都将严重灼伤，地面亦会燃起大火。必须不停移动才能逃脱。无法射击过近目标。</FH_Gun_BastionmeldTrackingLaser.description>
  <!-- EN: Beam Incinerator Cannon -->
  <FH_Gun_BastionmeldTrackingLaser.verbs.Beam_Incinerator_Cannon.label>焚灭脉冲炮</FH_Gun_BastionmeldTrackingLaser.verbs.Beam_Incinerator_Cannon.label>
  
</LanguageData>